{"track":"python","category":"딕셔너리","level":2,"title":"딕셔너리 합치기","desc":"<p>두 딕셔너리를 합친 <b>새 딕셔너리</b>를 돌려주는 <code>merge_dicts(a, b)</code>를 만드세요. 같은 키는 <code>b</code>의 값이 이겨요. 원본은 바꾸지 마세요.</p>","starter":"def merge_dicts(a, b):\n    pass\n","solution":"def merge_dicts(a, b):\n    result = dict(a)\n    result.update(b)\n    return result\n","hint":"<p><code>dict(a)</code>로 복사한 뒤 <code>update(b)</code>로 덮어써요. 또는 <code>{**a, **b}</code>.</p>","tests":[{"call":"merge_dicts({\"a\": 1}, {\"b\": 2})","expected":{"a":1,"b":2},"visible":true},{"call":"merge_dicts({\"a\": 1}, {\"a\": 5})","expected":{"a":5},"visible":true},{"call":"merge_dicts({}, {})","expected":{},"visible":false},{"call":"merge_dicts({\"x\": 1, \"y\": 2}, {\"y\": 3})","expected":{"x":1,"y":3},"visible":false}],"id":"py-062"}